sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Harness / artifacts
    participant F as Artifact files
    participant S as SQLite / manifest
    H->>H: Establish pin under publication lock
    H->>F: Write same-directory temporary body
    H->>F: fsync, integrity check, atomic publish
    F-->>H: Durable readable body reference
    H->>S: Commit manifest references and post-state
    S-->>H: Release temporary pin after commit
    H->>F: GC retains current and historical reachable bodies
